| Bluetooth support report: double-click, then send the file that opens.
Set BTReport$File <Wimp$ScrapDir>.BluetoothReport
Echo Bluetooth support report { > <BTReport$File> }
Echo --- module { >> <BTReport$File> }
Help BluetoothVoice { >> <BTReport$File> }
Echo --- boot { >> <BTReport$File> }
Show Boot$Dir { >> <BTReport$File> }
Show BootResources$Path { >> <BTReport$File> }
Show Choices$Path { >> <BTReport$File> }
Echo --- USB { >> <BTReport$File> }
USBDevices { >> <BTReport$File> }
Help USBDriver { >> <BTReport$File> }
Echo --- modules { >> <BTReport$File> }
Modules { >> <BTReport$File> }
Echo --- core state and notes { >> <BTReport$File> }
BASIC -quit <Obey$Dir>.ReportProg { >> <BTReport$File> }
Filer_Run <BTReport$File>
